Subject: [PATCH] opt

---
 Thermal/j2lte-thermal-guard.sh | 65 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 Thermal/j2lte-thermal-tune.sh  | 71 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 Thermal/j2lte-thermal.rc       | 10 +++++
 device.mk                      | 13 +++++--
